/target
# Cargo.lock IS committed — mc_tunnel is a binary, so a pinned lockfile gives
# reproducible + auditable builds (cargo audit). (un-ignored 2026-06-09, D8)

# build.rs writes the embedded client secret (the real private-key seed in a
# release build) to $OUT_DIR/client_secret.rs, which is under /target above.
# There is no client_secret.rs in src/ any more; do not add one. If a build
# ever puts that file back in src/, it is a bug, and it would hold the key.
